  "knownGaps": [
    "/carrier/serviceCode is passed through unchanged unless the serviceCode parameter is sent, so another carrier's code reaches FedEx as is.",
    "totalWeight is the sum of package weights and assumes every package uses the same weight unit.",
    "An address with line3 but no line2 leaves a gap in streetLines and fails the schema.",
    "Only clientReferenceId is sent as a customer reference; purchaseOrderNumber and invoiceNumber are not.",
    "International shipments need customs line items plus contentsType or incoterm. Customs data with no line items is dropped, since FedEx takes no customs block without commodities.",
    "shipDatestamp and dutiesPayment are not sent; FedEx uses today and its own default.",
    "Only the first recipient is sent."
  ]
